<title>JAPAN: Osaka bourse seeks to list food wholesaler Daisui.</title>
<headline>Osaka bourse seeks to list food wholesaler Daisui.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said on Tuesday it has applied to the Finance Ministry to list shares of Daisui Co Ltd on the second section of the bourse on March 5.</p>
<p>Daisui, a seafood wholesaler, is not listed on any other exchanges, it said.</p>
<p>A total 2.0 million shares will be offered and the payment date is March 4, it said.</p>
</text>
